- In `<thead>`: remove `border-b` from the `<tr className="text-muted-foreground border-b text-left text-xs font-medium">` (leaving `text-muted-foreground text-left text-xs font-medium`), and instead give EVERY `<th scope="col">` the classes `border-border/70 sticky top-0 z-10 border-b bg-card` in addition to its existing padding classes. The first four th have `pr-4 pb-2`, the last has `pb-2` only — keep those, just add the sticky classes.

